values.content:
Summarize this team standup.

Team: {{ $json.teamName }}
Date: {{ $json.standupDate }}
Sprint: {{ $json.sprintName || 'not specified' }}
Sprint goal: {{ $json.sprintGoal || 'not specified' }}

Individual updates:
{{ $json.updates.map(u=>u.name+(u.role?' ('+u.role+')':'')+' — Yesterday: '+u.yesterday+' | Today: '+u.today+(u.blockers?' | Blocked: '+u.blockers:'')).join('\n\n') }}

Return JSON:
{"team_pulse":"one of: green|yellow|red","pulse_rationale":"1-2 sentences on overall team health and momentum today","sprint_goal_status":"on_track|at_risk|blocked|not_applicable","sprint_status_note":"how today's updates relate to the sprint goal","collective_focus":["themes that appear across multiple people's updates"],"blockers":[{"blocker":"","who_affected":["names"],"severity":"critical|significant|minor","suggested_action":""}],"progress_highlights":["notable completions or momentum worth calling out"],"risks":["risks to the sprint or team velocity visible in these updates"],"manager_attention_items":["specific things the team lead should follow up on today"],"async_decisions_needed":["any decisions that should be made async to unblock people"],"slack_digest":"a short Slack-friendly digest under 200 words — the team summary someone could post in a channel. No bullet-point wall. Conversational."}
